Animation
---------
To animate CSS elements

@keyframe myName{
    from{font-size:20px}
    to{font-size: 40px;}
}



Animation properties
--------------------
animation-name
animation-duration
animation-timing-function
animation-delay
animation-iteration-count
animation-direction


% in Animation
---------------
@keyframe myName{
    0%{font-size: 20px;}
    50%{font-size: 30px;}
    100%{font-size: 40px;}
}